OL,3,GNEWSAKatie Price 'coached' alleged
OL,4,Avictim, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FKieran Hayler has told jurors he
OL,7,Fthought his ex-wife Katie Price was
OL,8,F"coaching" a 13-year-old girl he is
OL,9,Faccused of raping after discovering
OL,10,Fmessages she sent to the alleged
OL,11,Fvictim.
OL,13,FHayler, 39, said he took photographs of
OL,14,Fmessages on Price's phone in which she
OL,15,Fdiscussed claims that he fancied the
OL,16,Fgirl and wrote: "I will make you a
OL,17,Flittle star."
OL,19,FHayler is on trial at Lewes Crown Court
OL,20,Faccused of three counts of rape and one
OL,21,Fcount of sexual assault involving the
OL,22,Fteenager in West Sussex in 2016.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
